{"item_uid": "指考101-civics-037", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "civics", "subject_zh": "公民與社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 38, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "有關暴利稅性質的敘述，下列何者正確？", "options": {"A": "樂透中獎繳納的稅，是針對交易行為課徵的間接稅", "B": "樂透中獎人被課稅，是因為發行樂透公司將租稅轉嫁給消費者", "C": "樂透中獎人會被課稅，但人們可以選擇不購買，故符合效率原則", "D": "樂透中獎人被課的稅率，高於一般勞動者所得的稅率，符合公平原則"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "38-39", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 11.0, "B": 9.0, "C": 11.0, "D": 69.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 3.0, "B": 4.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 88.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 20.0, "B": 12.0, "C": 18.0, "D": 50.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 69.0, "p_high": 88.0, "p_low": 50.0, "discrimination": 38.0, "p_quintiles": [92.0, 81.0, 70.0, 60.0, 44.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
